---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';

const schema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'CollectionPage',
  name: 'Practical Tools | Mercer Lane Press',
  description: 'Free calculators and practical downloadable tools from Mercer Lane Press.',
  url: 'https://mercerlanepress.com/tools/'
};
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Practical Tools"
  description="Free calculators and downloadable Excel systems from Mercer Lane Press for construction estimating, PTO accrual, performance reviews and recurring HR administration."
  schema={schema}
>
  <Breadcrumbs items={[{name:'Home',href:'/'},{name:'Tools'}]}/>

  <header class="page-head wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">PRACTICAL TOOLS</p>
    <h1>Useful tools for specific problems</h1>
    <p class="lede">Focused calculators and working systems built around the same practical approach as Mercer Lane Press books and guides.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="section"><div class="wrap"><h2>Vending machine tools</h2><article class="card"><h3><a href="/tools/vending-machine-profit-calculator/">Vending Machine Location &amp; Profit Calculator</a></h3><p>Compare contribution, break-even sales, equipment recovery and location evidence. Free, with no signup.</p><a class="text-link" href="/tools/vending-machine-profit-calculator/">Use the vending calculator</a></article></div></section>
  <section class="section section-tint">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Construction estimating and job-costing tools</h2>
        <p>Start with a free arithmetic check when you already know the cost base, or use the full Excel estimating spreadsheet when scope, takeoff, cost build-up, review, client output and post-job learning need to stay connected.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-3">
        <article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">FREE BROWSER CALCULATOR</p><h3><a href="/tools/construction-job-profit-calculator/">Construction Job Profit Calculator</a></h3><p>Check revenue, costs, gross profit, contribution, margin and markup. Compare estimated with actual or forecast figures for one job.</p><p><a class="text-link" href="/tools/construction-job-profit-calculator/">Calculate job profit →</a></p><p><a href="/construction-job-costing/">Learn the job-costing workflow</a></p></article>
        <article class="card">
          <p class="eyebrow">FREE BROWSER CALCULATOR</p>
          <h3><a href="/tools/contractor-markup-margin-calculator/">Contractor Markup &amp; Margin Calculator</a></h3>
          <p>Enter a cost base and either a markup or target margin. See the selling price, profit amount, markup and true margin side by side.</p>
          <p><a class="text-link" href="/tools/contractor-markup-margin-calculator/">Use the free calculator →</a></p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <p class="eyebrow">DOWNLOADABLE MICROSOFT EXCEL SYSTEM</p>
          <h3><a href="/tools/construction-estimating-system-pro/">Construction Estimating &amp; Job Costing Toolkit PRO</a></h3>
          <p>Two focused Excel desktop workbooks: Estimate &amp; Quote Builder and Job Cost &amp; Profit Control. Complete v3.2 package: US$19.99 plus applicable tax, one-time purchase.</p>
          <p><a class="text-link" href="/tools/construction-estimating-system-pro/">Explore the construction estimating spreadsheet →</a></p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><h2>Landscape estimating and job-costing system</h2><p>Keep scope, quantities, costs, pricing, customer quotes and completed-job learning connected.</p></div><article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">PAID DIGITAL EXCEL SYSTEM</p><h3><a href="/tools/landscape-estimating-job-costing-system/">Landscape Contractor Estimating &amp; Job Costing System</a></h3><p>A 27-sheet landscape estimating spreadsheet with clean and Demo workbooks, three PDF guides and a README. Track actual costs and approved changes, then review final job profit. One-time digital purchase through Etsy.</p><a class="text-link" href="/tools/landscape-estimating-job-costing-system/">See the landscape system →</a><p><a href="/landscape-contractor-estimating/">Read the free landscape estimating guides</a></p></article></div></section>

  <section class="section section-tint"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><h2>Home energy and heat pump tools</h2><p>Estimate air-source heat pump electricity use and running costs using your own assumptions, then read the free owner guides for troubleshooting context.</p></div><article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">FREE UK CALCULATOR</p><h3><a href="/tools/heat-pump-running-cost-calculator/">Heat Pump Running Cost Calculator</a></h3><p>Enter actual electricity use or estimated heat demand and COP, your tariff and period to see daily and period costs.</p><a class="text-link" href="/tools/heat-pump-running-cost-calculator/">Calculate heat pump costs →</a></article></div></section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap narrow">
      <h2>Tools support decisions; they do not replace the work behind them</h2>
      <p>A calculator can check arithmetic. A workbook can make assumptions visible. Neither can tell you automatically whether the project scope is complete, whether a labour assumption is realistic, whether a subcontract quotation covers the same work, or whether your business is recovering its costs consistently.</p>
      <p>Where a tool depends on business-specific inputs, use your own current information and appropriate professional advice where needed.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-tint">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>HR tools</h2>
        <p>Use a focused free tool for a single calculation or review, then move into the complete toolkit when recurring HR work needs to stay connected.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-3">
        <article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">FREE BROWSER CALCULATOR</p><h3><a href="/tools/pto-accrual-calculator/">PTO Accrual Calculator</a></h3><p>Calculate PTO earned per period, accrued PTO to date, available balance, days equivalent and projected year-end balance from your own policy figures.</p><a class="text-link" href="/tools/pto-accrual-calculator/">Calculate PTO accrual →</a></article>
        <article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">FREE DOWNLOAD + BROWSER TOOL</p><h3><a href="/free-tools/performance-review-template-excel/">Free Performance Review Starter Kit</a></h3><p>An Excel workbook, editable Word form, A4 and US Letter PDFs, and an optional client-side AI Review Prompt Builder. One employee and one review at a time; no signup required.</p><a class="text-link" href="/free-tools/performance-review-template-excel/">Use the free review tool →</a></article>
        <article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">COMPLETE HR SYSTEM</p><h3><a href="/tools/hr-manager-toolkit/">HR Manager Toolkit + AI Productivity System</a></h3><p>31 Excel sheets for recurring HR work, 48 HR prompts and 22 editable form designs. $24.99 USD, one-time purchase.</p><a class="text-link" href="/tools/hr-manager-toolkit/">Explore the complete HR toolkit →</a></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><h2>Family admin tools</h2><p>A practical working system for household tasks, dates and follow-ups.</p></div><article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">EXCEL WORKBOOK + PRINTABLE BUNDLE</p><h3><a href="/tools/family-admin-operating-system/">Family Admin Operating System</a></h3><p>Clean and demo Excel workbooks, a 15-page Quick Start and ten printable pages in A4 and US Letter. £7.49, one-time purchase. Microsoft 365 desktop Excel required.</p><a class="text-link" href="/tools/family-admin-operating-system/">Explore the family admin bundle →</a></article></div></section>
  <section class="section section-tint"><div class="wrap prose"><p class="eyebrow">FREE WEEKLY RESET PLANNER</p><h2>Make a plan for your next two weeks</h2><p>Turn a few household tasks, dates and replies to chase into a printable reset plan. Choose the next action, owner and checkpoint date. No signup or Excel needed.</p><p><a class="button button-secondary" href="/tools/family-admin-reset-planner/">Try the free family admin planner</a></p></div></section>
<section class="section section-tint"><div class="wrap prose"><h2>Put the operating method into practice</h2><p><a href="/tools/fleet-maintenance-due-calculator/">Calculate one verified maintenance rule by date or mileage</a> with the free browser tool. For recurring records across several vehicles, explore the <a href="/tools/small-fleet-maintenance-system/">Small Fleet Maintenance System</a>, a separate Excel workbook and forms product. The book teaches the method; the digital product supplies working files. The book is sold separately.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
